  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Sustainability Program for Economic Development I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Sostenibilidad Fiscal para el Desarrollo Econmico I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es restablecer la sostenibilidad fiscal y promover un mayor crecimiento econmico. Esto se har a travs de: (i) el fortalecimiento del sistema y la administracin de ingresos tributarios; (ii) aumentar el control y la eficiencia del gasto pblico; (iii) mejorar la planificacin y gestin macrofiscal; y (iv) reducir los riesgos fiscales y aumentar la transparencia de las Empresas Pblicas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to restore fiscal sustainability and promote higher economic growth. This will be done through: (i) strengthening the tax revenue system and administration; (ii) increasing control and efficiency of public expenditure; (iii) improving macro-fiscal planning and management; and (iv) reducing fiscal risks and increasing transparency of State-Owned Enterprises (SOEs).</narrative>
  </description>
